  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你知道吗，一定要对自己的私事守口如瓶，你只要敢打探我的隐私，我就一定会骗你，你只要敢问我让我尴尬的问题，我就一定会说谎，边界感是成年人该有的体面，秋分这个节气最妙的就在一个分字，你要恰如其分地，守护自己的边界感。一年走到这里，白昼与黑夜刚好等长，请在这一天提醒自己，天地万物，皆有分寸。#秋分节气 #秋天 #治愈感 #成长",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_a4374858226b6926_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 143.708005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "诸君，你知道吗？一定要对自己的私事守口如瓶。你只要敢打探我的隐私，我就一定会骗你。你只要敢问，我让我尴尬的问题，我就一定会说谎。打听本身就是一种恶意，这个不是冷漠哦，一旦发现别人摸你的底，你就胡说八道。如果在秋分这一天，你抬头看一看，天会发现一个神奇的现象。大树的树冠会羞涩的保持一定的距离，空隙彼此礼让，这叫树冠。修弊，是植物特边界界，而这种边界感也是成年人该有的体面。秋分这个节气最妙的就在一个分字，你要恰如其分的守护好自己的边界感。我们在九月二十三号迎来了秋分节气，是一年中最讲究平衡的日子。秋分者，阴阳相伴也，故昼夜君而寒暑平。一年走在这里，白昼与黑夜，刚好等长，请在这一天提醒自己，天地万物皆有分寸。要对你身边的人说，我们只是一起上班，并不是朋友，我们只是一起上学，我们不是朋友一起上班，那叫同事一起上学，那叫同学离开。这个环境之后，我们没有任何关系，我们只是在特定场合才会产生交情的人。离开这个环境，我们的话题无法延伸，为什么要用朋友的名义越界来刺探我的生活？最怕的就是交浅言深。人和人刚认识的时候，最好虚伪又热情，新鲜又浪漫。但人和事走太近都不壮观，尤其不要轻易好为人师，主动交人就是结仇的态始。你以为是在帮他他觉得你是在俯视他，认知不在一个层次，指导，就是冒犯，要珍惜。那些一开始并不很热情、很克制的朋友，当一个人向你树立边界时，其实是在想方设法把你留在他的生命里。边界不是墙，是篱笆墙，是用来挡住人的，而篱笆是用来告诉别人。这里面有花，请从门进来，就像你去饭店吃饭，说出自己的忌口是为了点菜，而不是离开。你看，一夜秋风，一夜秋风秋天的景色被白昼和黑夜平均分配，这就是平分秋色。暑热消退，一半寒凉，生长一半山色不浓。不淡湖光不深不浅，愿我们亲疏有度，远近相安，久处不厌。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00001",
      "start_ms": 410,
      "end_ms": 810,
      "text": "诸君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1150,
      "end_ms": 1890,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2090,
      "end_ms": 4690,
      "text": "一定要对自己的私事守口如瓶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5170,
      "end_ms": 6970,
      "text": "你只要敢打探我的隐私，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7190,
      "end_ms": 8290,
      "text": "我就一定会骗你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8710,
      "end_ms": 9530,
      "text": "你只要敢问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9530,
      "end_ms": 10850,
      "text": "我让我尴尬的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10930,
      "end_ms": 12050,
      "text": "我就一定会说谎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12490,
      "end_ms": 14570,
      "text": "打听本身就是一种恶意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14930,
      "end_ms": 16070,
      "text": "这个不是冷漠哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16250,
      "end_ms": 17810,
      "text": "一旦发现别人摸你的底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17890,
      "end_ms": 18990,
      "text": "你就胡说八道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19450,
      "end_ms": 20610,
      "text": "如果在秋分这一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20610,
      "end_ms": 21450,
      "text": "你抬头看一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00015",
      "start_ms": 21450,
      "end_ms": 23110,
      "text": "天会发现一个神奇的现象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00016",
      "start_ms": 23410,
      "end_ms": 26050,
      "text": "大树的树冠会羞涩的保持一定的距离，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00017",
      "start_ms": 26050,
      "end_ms": 27550,
      "text": "空隙彼此礼让，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00018",
      "start_ms": 27710,
      "end_ms": 28630,
      "text": "这叫树冠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00019",
      "start_ms": 28670,
      "end_ms": 29110,
      "text": "修弊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00020",
      "start_ms": 29310,
      "end_ms": 30860,
      "text": "是植物特边界界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00021",
      "start_ms": 31080,
      "end_ms": 33860,
      "text": "而这种边界感也是成年人该有的体面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00022",
      "start_ms": 34160,
      "end_ms": 36860,
      "text": "秋分这个节气最妙的就在一个分字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00023",
      "start_ms": 37200,
      "end_ms": 40460,
      "text": "你要恰如其分的守护好自己的边界感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00024",
      "start_ms": 40860,
      "end_ms": 43880,
      "text": "我们在九月二十三号迎来了秋分节气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00025",
      "start_ms": 44080,
      "end_ms": 46400,
      "text": "是一年中最讲究平衡的日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00026",
      "start_ms": 46640,
      "end_ms": 47360,
      "text": "秋分者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00027",
      "start_ms": 47440,
      "end_ms": 48520,
      "text": "阴阳相伴也，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00028",
      "start_ms": 48520,
      "end_ms": 50740,
      "text": "故昼夜君而寒暑平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00029",
      "start_ms": 50740,
      "end_ms": 52180,
      "text": "一年走在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52180,
      "end_ms": 53260,
      "text": "白昼与黑夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53260,
      "end_ms": 54160,
      "text": "刚好等长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00032",
      "start_ms": 54160,
      "end_ms": 55840,
      "text": "请在这一天提醒自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00033",
      "start_ms": 55840,
      "end_ms": 57960,
      "text": "天地万物皆有分寸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00034",
      "start_ms": 58000,
      "end_ms": 59500,
      "text": "要对你身边的人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00035",
      "start_ms": 59500,
      "end_ms": 61290,
      "text": "我们只是一起上班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00036",
      "start_ms": 61330,
      "end_ms": 62230,
      "text": "并不是朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00037",
      "start_ms": 62450,
      "end_ms": 63650,
      "text": "我们只是一起上学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00038",
      "start_ms": 63770,
      "end_ms": 66000,
      "text": "我们不是朋友一起上班，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00039",
      "start_ms": 66060,
      "end_ms": 67750,
      "text": "那叫同事一起上学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00040",
      "start_ms": 67990,
      "end_ms": 69630,
      "text": "那叫同学离开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00041",
      "start_ms": 69630,
      "end_ms": 70550,
      "text": "这个环境之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00042",
      "start_ms": 70650,
      "end_ms": 71885,
      "text": "我们没有任何关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00043",
      "start_ms": 72240,
      "end_ms": 75135,
      "text": "我们只是在特定场合才会产生交情的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00044",
      "start_ms": 75380,
      "end_ms": 76360,
      "text": "离开这个环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00045",
      "start_ms": 76380,
      "end_ms": 77935,
      "text": "我们的话题无法延伸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00046",
      "start_ms": 78320,
      "end_ms": 81320,
      "text": "为什么要用朋友的名义越界来刺探我的生活？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00047",
      "start_ms": 81540,
      "end_ms": 83425,
      "text": "最怕的就是交浅言深。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00048",
      "start_ms": 83880,
      "end_ms": 85160,
      "text": "人和人刚认识的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00049",
      "start_ms": 85160,
      "end_ms": 86800,
      "text": "最好虚伪又热情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87000,
      "end_ms": 88035,
      "text": "新鲜又浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00051",
      "start_ms": 88260,
      "end_ms": 90875,
      "text": "但人和事走太近都不壮观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00052",
      "start_ms": 91310,
      "end_ms": 92975,
      "text": "尤其不要轻易好为人师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00053",
      "start_ms": 93360,
      "end_ms": 95505,
      "text": "主动交人就是结仇的态始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00054",
      "start_ms": 95780,
      "end_ms": 98515,
      "text": "你以为是在帮他他觉得你是在俯视他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00055",
      "start_ms": 98890,
      "end_ms": 100130,
      "text": "认知不在一个层次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00056",
      "start_ms": 100170,
      "end_ms": 100610,
      "text": "指导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00057",
      "start_ms": 100610,
      "end_ms": 101305,
      "text": "就是冒犯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00058",
      "start_ms": 101660,
      "end_ms": 102120,
      "text": "要珍惜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00059",
      "start_ms": 102120,
      "end_ms": 104735,
      "text": "那些一开始并不很热情、很克制的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00060",
      "start_ms": 105140,
      "end_ms": 107035,
      "text": "当一个人向你树立边界时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00061",
      "start_ms": 107380,
      "end_ms": 110235,
      "text": "其实是在想方设法把你留在他的生命里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00062",
      "start_ms": 110540,
      "end_ms": 111480,
      "text": "边界不是墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00063",
      "start_ms": 111600,
      "end_ms": 112990,
      "text": "是篱笆墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00064",
      "start_ms": 113030,
      "end_ms": 114090,
      "text": "是用来挡住人的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00065",
      "start_ms": 114090,
      "end_ms": 115815,
      "text": "而篱笆是用来告诉别人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00066",
      "start_ms": 116030,
      "end_ms": 116770,
      "text": "这里面有花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00067",
      "start_ms": 116990,
      "end_ms": 118045,
      "text": "请从门进来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00068",
      "start_ms": 118510,
      "end_ms": 119690,
      "text": "就像你去饭店吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00069",
      "start_ms": 119790,
      "end_ms": 121810,
      "text": "说出自己的忌口是为了点菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00070",
      "start_ms": 121950,
      "end_ms": 123065,
      "text": "而不是离开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00071",
      "start_ms": 123630,
      "end_ms": 123970,
      "text": "你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00072",
      "start_ms": 124250,
      "end_ms": 125110,
      "text": "一夜秋风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00073",
      "start_ms": 125230,
      "end_ms": 129660,
      "text": "一夜秋风秋天的景色被白昼和黑夜平均分配，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00074",
      "start_ms": 129800,
      "end_ms": 131685,
      "text": "这就是平分秋色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00075",
      "start_ms": 132260,
      "end_ms": 133260,
      "text": "暑热消退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00076",
      "start_ms": 133280,
      "end_ms": 134260,
      "text": "一半寒凉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00077",
      "start_ms": 134380,
      "end_ms": 136490,
      "text": "生长一半山色不浓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00078",
      "start_ms": 136490,
      "end_ms": 138735,
      "text": "不淡湖光不深不浅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00079",
      "start_ms": 139160,
      "end_ms": 140580,
      "text": "愿我们亲疏有度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00080",
      "start_ms": 140840,
      "end_ms": 142085,
      "text": "远近相安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a4374858226b6926_s00081",
      "start_ms": 142490,
      "end_ms": 143395,
      "text": "久处不厌。"
    }
  ],
